sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Holder of version N
    participant E as Replica that restarted empty
    participant C as Nodes closest to the DID
    participant O as Owner
    Note over H: hourly republication of records older than an hour
    H->>E: STORE(version N)
    E->>C: FindHash(key)
    C-->>E: seq and hash of their record
    alt a quorum holds version N or confirms N-1
        Note over E: R5 accepts
        E-->>H: Stored
    else fewer than the quorum
        Note over E: too few votes: refuse, no answer
        Note over O: at least every 24 hours, or when it comes back
        O->>E: STORE(version 0), then UPDATE(1) to UPDATE(N)
        Note over E: version 0 needs no votes,<br/>each next version is checked against the one before
        E-->>O: Stored, then Updated
    end
